{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id163271431"}, "name":{"label":"Andie204"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-07-07T10:17:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.88.1"}, "id":{"label":"12863993499"}, "title":{"label":"Loving the app"}, "content":{"label":"I’m enjoying this app. I appreciate it comes from fellow Torontonians. I really like the visuals and the smart reminder, meaning it doesn’t pop all the time if I had already logged an entry.\n\nI wish the widget had the character view option and not the silhouette.\n\nAlso I would appreciate an ACCESSIBLE mode that doesn’t trigger anxiety – without the gamifications “streaks”, or “challenges”, or “achievements” to unlock. These stuff could be just hidden as an option.\n\nAlso I’m not a scientist but some drinks having negative hydration like “-95%” made no sense to me. I prompted different AI tools in many different ways to do a deep search on scientific papers INCLUDING the ones referenced in the APP, and not a single entry agreed on having these percentages. While others like “coffee” I got higher hydration numbers than 60%.\n\nI wish I could edit the % myself easily. Instead I had the tedious job to create new entries manually one by one. And now my list is double the length.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
